A||||9||Eric||Flowmaster Options||||1||
Z||000000||Eric||02-15-2001||11:28 PM||||I'm planning on getting a custom exhaust bent for my GT.  I'm probably going to use 2.5" diameter pipe, eliminate the cat, and use a single-in single-out Flowmaster muffler because they're available in the smaller size.  I want some good noise on full throttle, but I want to keep it non-deafening for the rest of the time, hopefully not much louder than the stock setup when cruising.  What series should I buy?  And is mandrel bent exhaust worth the added cost?  How much more should I expect to pay if I go with mandrel bends?||||reg||1
Z||000001||fierosound||02-15-2001||11:41 PM||||Ricecooker has a flowmaster (the large one) with no cat. convertor and splitting into twin exhausts.  I can say IT IS louder than stock.  You may want to add resonator tips afterward to lessen the noise.  I've got the BORLA exhaust, and even with the cat. convertor it is just slightly louder than stock.||||reg||10
Z||000002||Eric||02-15-2001||11:45 PM||||I've really go my heart set on a single out on the driver's side.  Will not buy the tip until I listen to it.||||reg||1
Z||000003||RiceCooker||02-16-2001||10:10 AM||||Yeah Eric i've got the flowmaster muffler. <BR>I'm not sure the part # but it's the camaro one. <BR>I also have fiero store sprint manifolds (FieroSound calls them fake headers)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> and 2 1/4" piping. It is very much louder than stock all the time. (I want it to sound like a V8 until i can actually afford one) And cruising the highway it gets pretty loud since i only have a 4 spd the rpms get high. I probably wouldn't like it as much if i couldn't completely drown it out with Pearl Jam when i wanted to.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Maybe resonators would lessen the sound - but i'm not too experienced with those.<BR>You can see pics of my tips at: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004312.html" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004312.html</A> <P>Anything else, just ask<BR>Todd||||reg||6
Z||000004||80's BOY||02-16-2001||11:32 AM||||yeah, but what he's asking is which Flowmaster will fit in place of the cat. convertor to give out good sound. i actually did a search on this yesterday with little results. right now i have a custom setup where i tossed the cat,put a glasspack in its place, tossed the muffler and bought 2 resonated dual tips from the fiero store. i lost lots of low-end torque, and the glass pack is burned out and loud as hell when i drive now. i want to replace the glasspack with a Flowmaster muffler, but which one??||||reg||14
